# =====================================================================
# BioSync AI - Monorepo Environment Configuration Template (.env.example)
# Public Repository Template: Instructions for local and cloud deployment
# =====================================================================

# 1. Server Configuration (server/.env)
# Copy server/.env.example to server/.env and fill in your MongoDB URI, JWT Secret, and API keys.

# 2. AI Engine Configuration (ai-engine/.env)
# Copy ai-engine/.env.example to ai-engine/.env and configure Python host/port.

# 3. Admin Operations Portal (admin-panel/.env)
# Copy admin-panel/.env.example to admin-panel/.env and configure VITE_API_URL.

# 4. User Mobile & Web Application (user-panel/.env)
# Copy user-panel/.env.example to user-panel/.env and configure EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL.

# 5. Staff Phlebotomy Application (staff-panel/.env)
# Copy staff-panel/.env.example to staff-panel/.env and configure EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL.
